1
00:00:07,289 --> 00:00:09,875
Ji-sung? Where are you?

2
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:13,463
Don't move. Watch your knees.

3
00:00:18,518 --> 00:00:20,645
I'm sorry.

4
00:00:21,337 --> 00:00:22,755
Seung‑hyun!

5
00:00:46,958 --> 00:00:48,752
The power is back.

6
00:00:51,715 --> 00:00:54,718
This building's old...

7
00:00:55,554 --> 00:00:58,557
Can you stand?

8
00:01:00,848 --> 00:01:04,185
I don't know.

9
00:01:04,689 --> 00:01:05,689
Huh?

10
00:01:06,647 --> 00:01:09,149
I said I don't know.

11
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:12,988
Ugh, why'd the lights have to
come back on now.

12
00:01:16,074 --> 00:01:20,579
Close your eyes for a sec?

13
00:01:22,665 --> 00:01:24,876
What?

14
00:01:26,202 --> 00:01:28,747
Close your eyes.

15
00:01:29,739 --> 00:01:31,407
One

16
00:01:32,675 --> 00:01:34,260
two

17
00:01:35,428 --> 00:01:37,257
three.
